 952:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
 953:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                have wrong result.
